RESEARCH USE ONLY

This dataset and accompanying materials are made available for research use
only. Records P5-F-001 through P5-F-033 and the sprint-review records are
drawn from work derived from orcarouter uncensored-weights artifacts; the
TimesFM and Job Killer records carry no weight-derived content. See
dataset/README.md and dataset/dataset-metadata.json for the full license
note and provenance. External submissions via SUBMISSION-FORMAT.md may set
per-record licenses.
